!
! Volume through one stage of the cellar (vintner_model.h VN2), in
! Trebago: what came in (before) minus what went on (after) minus what
! was lost on the way, in millilitres, one stage per row, exact. 0 is a
! stage that conserves its volume; anything else is unaccounted for. A
! result past 64 bits is refused, never wrapped.
trebago gap
  in  before(n), after(n), loss(n)
  out gap(n)
  gap(i) = before(i) - after(i) - loss(i)
end
